{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17178","headline":"璩授京兆府参军戏书以示兼呈独孤郎 · 权德舆","name":"璩授京兆府参军戏书以示兼呈独孤郎","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"见尔府中趋，初官足慰吾。\n老牛还舐犊，凡鸟亦将雏。\n喜至翻成感，痴来或欲殊。\n因慙玉润客，应笑此非夫。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17178.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17178","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}